# Architecture

This repository is a Next.js application starter. App-Framework owns reusable packages and the capability catalogue. Do not reimplement those packages here.

- Application routes, styling, and configuration values stay in this repository.
- Import `@app-framework/app-config` and `@app-framework/dev-tools` from the package root only.
- Use published semver ranges. Do not add a `file:` or `git` dependency on App-Framework.
- Propose a new shared capability in App-Framework instead of copying it into the template.
- Do not add optional product features, a component library, or a second catalogue without a real requirement.
- `pnpm check` is the full verification. Pre-commit stays limited to lint-staged.

The ownership split is documented in `docs/RESPONSIBILITIES.md`.
